                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Options" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">GEDTM30
Auto (best bare-earth)
USGS 3DEP
Canada HRDEM
Austria ALS DTM
Bavaria DGM1
North Rhine-Westphalia DGM1
Rhineland-Palatinate DGM1
Hesse DGM1
Brandenburg DGM1
Lower Saxony DGM1
Emilia-Romagna coast DTM
South Tyrol DTM
Luxembourg LiDAR DTM
Netherlands AHN DTM
swissALTI3D
France IGN (LiDAR HD + RGE ALTI)
Scotland LiDAR DTM
Wales LiDAR DTM
England LiDAR composite DTM
Poland NMT
Czechia DMR 5G
Norway DTM1
Estonia DTM 5 m
Tasmania 2 m DEM
Copernicus GLO-30 (surface model)</item>
