                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Options" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ERA5 (Open-Meteo)
ISD station (NOAA)
EPW files
CSV file
City of London Annex A
Global Wind Atlas (.lib file)
GHCNh station (NOAA)</item>
