                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">EN 1991-1-4 category the SOURCE speeds stand for. II (open country) for ERA5 — ECMWF brings its 10 m wind down with a short-grass roughness of 0.03 m — and for a WMO-sited anemometer. Change it when the station is known to stand elsewhere.</item>
